      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어머, 당신.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n명탐정 마티에르의 조수 아니신가요?\n함께 있는 걸 몇 번 본 적 있어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4BA38002C0020B2F9C2E0002E00100001BE01000ABA85D0D0C8150020B9C8D2F0C5D0B974C7580020C870C2180020C544B2C8C2E0AC00C694003F000AD568AED80020C788B2940020AC780020BA870020BC880020BCF80020C8010020C788C5B4C694002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아닌데요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544B2CCB370C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조수라고 해야 하나...?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870C218B77CACE00020D574C57C0020D558B098002E002E002E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼, 저를 좀 도와주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC002C0020C800B97C0020C8800020B3C4C640C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제가 중요한 열쇠는\n클레피에게 맡겨 두고 있는데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81CAC000020C911C694D55C0020C5F4C1E0B294000AD074B808D53CC5D0AC8C0020B9E1ACA80020B450ACE00020C788B294B370002E002E002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "함께 외출을 나갔다가\n클레피가 그만<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n열쇠를 잃어버린 모양이에요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D568AED80020C678CD9CC7440020B098AC14B2E4AC00000AD074B808D53CAC000020ADF8B9CC00100001BE00000AC5F4C1E0B97C0020C783C5B4BC84B9B00020BAA8C591C774C5D0C694002E002E002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "짐작 가는 곳은 없어요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9D0C7910020AC00B2940020ACF3C7400020C5C6C5B4C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어디에 다녀왔는데요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B514C5D00020B2E4B140C654B294B370C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어디 보자... 그날은 분명\n처음 가 보는 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>헤어살롱<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>에 갔었어요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그래서 위치가 잘 기억이 나질 않아요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B5140020BCF4C790002E002E002E0020ADF8B0A0C7400020BD84BA85000ACC98C74C0020AC000020BCF4B294002000100002FF000006D5E4C5B4C0B4B87100100002FF000000C5D00020AC14C5C8C5B4C694002E00100001BE00000AADF8B798C11C0020C704CE58AC000020C7980020AE30C5B5C7740020B098C9C80020C54AC544C694002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "새 헤어스타일이 마음에 들어서\n기쁜 나머지 헤어살롱 근처에 있는<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>카페<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>에서 우아하게 티타임을 즐겼죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0C80020D5E4C5B4C2A4D0C0C77CC7740020B9C8C74CC5D00020B4E4C5B4C11C000AAE30C05C0020B098BA38C9C00020D5E4C5B4C0B4B8710020ADFCCC98C5D00020C788B29400100001BE00000A00100002FF000006CE74D39800100002FF000000C5D0C11C0020C6B0C544D558AC8C0020D2F0D0C0C784C7440020C990ACBCC8E0002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리고 카페 뒤편에 있는\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>배틀코트<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>에서 배틀을 하자고 초대를 받아서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n화려하게 승리를 거머쥐었어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9ACACE00020CE74D3980020B4A4D3B8C5D00020C788B294000A00100002FF000006BC30D2C0CF54D2B800100002FF000000C5D0C11C0020BC30D2C0C7440020D558C790ACE00020CD08B300B97C0020BC1BC544C11C00100001BE00000AD654B824D558AC8C0020C2B9B9ACB97C0020AC70BA38C950C5C8C5B4C694002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "처음 방문한 헤어살롱이 어딘지만 알면\n행적을 쫓기 쉬울 것 같은데 말이죠...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CC98C74C0020BC29BB38D55C0020D5E4C5B4C0B4B871C7740020C5B4B518C9C0B9CC0020C54CBA74000AD589C801C7440020CAD3AE300020C26CC6B80020AC830020AC19C740B3700020B9D0C774C8E0002E002E002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁드려요, 조수님.\n부디 열쇠를 찾아 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1B4DCB824C694002C0020C870C218B2D8002E000ABD80B5140020C5F4C1E0B97C0020CC3EC5440020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "열쇠를 잃어버린 날에는\n헤어살롱에 갔다가 카페에 들른 다음<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n뒤편에 있는 배틀코트로 이동했었어요.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n우선은 카페가 근처에 있는\n헤어살롱을 찾아 보시는 게 좋을 것 같아요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "화려한 열쇠를 찾았다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D654B824D55C0020C5F4C1E0B97C0020CC3EC558B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조수님! 이 배틀코트에서\n승부를 했던 게 떠올랐어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870C218B2D800210020C7740020BC30D2C0CF54D2B8C5D0C11C000AC2B9BD80B97C0020D588B3580020AC8C0020B5A0C62CB790C5B4C694002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "와아!\n열쇠를 찾아 주셨군요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C640C5440021000AC5F4C1E0B97C0020CC3EC5440020C8FCC168AD70C694002100100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "키키...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0A4D0A4002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "클레피, 열쇠를 잃어버린 건\n네 책임이 아니라<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n여기에 온 내 책임이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D074B808D53C002C0020C5F4C1E0B97C0020C783C5B4BC84B9B00020AC74000AB1240020CC45C784C7740020C544B2C8B77C00100001BE00000AC5ECAE30C5D00020C6280020B0B40020CC45C784C774C57C002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "키키?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0A4D0A4003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데, 클레피는 마음에 든 열쇠는\n절대 놓지 않는다고 들었어...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B370002C0020D074B808D53CB2940020B9C8C74CC5D00020B4E00020C5F4C1E0B294000AC808B3000020B193C9C00020C54AB294B2E4ACE00020B4E4C5C8C5B4002E002E002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니까 클레피, 앞으로는 네가\n마음에 들어 하는 열쇠만 맡기도록 할게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C8AE4C0020D074B808D53C002C0020C55EC73CB85CB2940020B124AC00000AB9C8C74CC5D00020B4E4C5B40020D558B2940020C5F4C1E0B9CC0020B9E1AE30B3C4B85D0020D560AC8C002100100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다른 열쇠는 내가 잘 가지고 있을 테니까.\n알았지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4B9780020C5F4C1E0B2940020B0B4AC000020C7980020AC00C9C0ACE00020C788C7440020D14CB2C8AE4C002E000AC54CC558C9C0003F00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "키키♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D0A4D0A4266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이제부터는 클레피와 내가\n역할과 책임을 절반씩 나눠 갖게 되는 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C81CBD80D130B2940020D074B808D53CC6400020B0B4AC00000AC5EDD560ACFC0020CC45C784C7440020C808BC18C5290020B098B2200020AC16AC8C0020B418B2940020AC70C57C002100100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고마워요, 조수님.\n제 보답을 받아 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B9C8C6CCC694002C0020C870C218B2D8002E000AC81C0020BCF4B2F5C7440020BC1BC5440020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 이만 실례할게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
